{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19538","headline":"和太原山亭怀古诗 · 张贾","name":"和太原山亭怀古诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中庭起崖谷，漱玉下涟漪。\n丹丘谁云远，寓象得心期。\n岂不贵锺鼎，至怀在希夷。\n唯当蓬莱阁，灵凤复来仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}